# UFC API
# The roster cache, stats cache, dataset, and trained models below are COMMITTED
# on purpose so the deployed demo works immediately without a slow cold-start
# scrape/train. Delete them locally to force a fresh rebuild (python train.py).
#   active_fighters.json      - roster for fuzzy name matching
#   fighter_stats_cache.json  - scraped stats used for predictions
#   fight_dataset.csv         - built training set
#   models/                   - trained models + backtest report

# Rebuild-only / transient artifacts (not needed at runtime):
fight_history_cache.json
fighter_stats.csv
ufc_pit_dataset.csv
demo_*.png
ufcstats_events.json
ufcstats_fighters.json
ufcstats_fight_details.json
ufcstats_cookie.json
ufcstats_events.json.tmp
ufcstats_fighters.json.tmp
ufcstats_fight_details.json.tmp
